      "basis": "REV-0109 independent reconstruction of ATT-0065 Sections 3-4. Related to, but distinct from, FND-0096 (which records the Fit_0=I_e statement) and FND-0046 (which requires Fitting/scheme structure, not just fibrewise equality); this candidate isolates the module-structure subtlety that makes the nonreduced argument work.",
